<div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col gap-6">
  <%= render FlatPack::PageTitle::Component.new(
    title: "Config",
    subtitle: "Current config keys plus the constraints for the future HTTP API registries.",
    variant: :h1
  ) %>

  <%= render FlatPack::CodeBlock::Component.new(
    language: :ruby,
    code: <<~'CODE'
      RecordingStudioApi.configure do |config|
        config.api_key = ENV["RECORDING_STUDIO_API_KEY"]
        config.enable_feature_x = false
        config.timeout = 5
      end
    CODE
  ) %>

  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm text-(--surface-content-color)">
    <li>Future API surfaces should be registered explicitly rather than inferred from Ruby constants.</li>
    <li>Nested resource declarations should mirror the recording tree so route semantics stay consistent.</li>
    <li>Boot should fail fast when an action points at a capability that is not enabled for the target recordable type.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
